The update includes:

Ammo Printer - a module which allows restocking ammo without having to return to a repair pad;
Auto Healing Behavior (Toggle Icon: http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/25738567/82d9568802765d647d444c28e7994bbb4ea0f5eb.png) - when enabled, units that are equipped with Maintenance Tools and/or Ammo Printers will automatically seek out nearest friendly units in need of repair, energy or ammo. Additionally, units can heal while performing other commands (move, mine etc. Note: the same unit cannot repair and attack at the same time).
Balance changes: Maintenance Tool now spawns with 100 ammo units (can still be restocked up to 500); earlier campaign missions now also have boostable factories;
Various minor bug fixes.


